# PROD instance. Caddy runs as a container in this dir's
# docker-compose.yml; `app` is the compose service name. Auto-HTTPS via
# Let's Encrypt, transparent WebSocket upgrade.
#
# The prod SSM tree's GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL must match this hostname.
